+### NVIDIA Isaac Sim: animated USD and a four-camera video
+
+The same recording can be replayed in **NVIDIA Isaac Sim** instead of the Meshcat HTML: `scripts/export_usd.py` writes
+an animated USD (body poses as time samples, the same meshes, cameras, T1/T2 overlays and scenery; visual only, no
+physics), `scripts/isaac_view.py` opens it in the Isaac Sim window with a free camera, and
+`scripts/isaac_render_video.py` renders an MP4 with four cameras in one frame. MuJoCo still runs the evaluation;
+nothing is retrained. `scripts/eval_xgh.py --detach potek` replaces the twist of the harvest by a sideways snap while
+lifting. Details, options and what has / has not been tested: [docs/ISAAC_SIM.md](docs/ISAAC_SIM.md).
+
+---
+
